<title>USA: Philip Morris may issue $500 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris may issue $500 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Morris is expected to issue $500 million in 10-year notes on Tuesday, via lead manager Lehman Brothers according to market sources.</p>
<p>The A2/A non-callable notes has price talk of 76 to 78 basis points over comparable U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>(( - Caryn Trokie 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
